<title>FRANCE: Cardif 1996 income rises.</title>
<headline>Cardif 1996 income rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs) 57    vs		49.4</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		   10    vs		10</p>
<p>    Net attributable			 340.1  vs	     293.3</p>
<p>    Net new provisions			71.9  vs		60.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Cardif, an insurance subsidiary of Compagnie Bancaire, reported its results in a statement.</p>
</text>
